{"id":"627474","name":"鹌鹑蛋肉包","author":"玉膳～美食","authorId":"10631012","desc":"","cover":"images/627474/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"250g"},{"name":"糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"鹌鹑蛋","amount":"15个"}],"sub":[{"name":"麻油","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"2匙"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"10颗"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"g面粉中，加入5g酵母、250g温开水揉面。","img":"images/627474/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"揉到面光、盆光、手光，大约5分钟；盖上保鲜膜或盖子发酵。","img":"images/627474/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"发酵至2倍大。","img":"images/627474/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"出现蜂窝状。","img":"images/627474/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"二次揉面，分成均匀的机子小荠子，每个大约45g","img":"images/627474/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"凉水上锅，盖上盖子，再次醒发20分钟。","img":"images/627474/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"开大火，水开后调中火蒸15分钟，关火再闷5分钟后开锅盖。","img":"images/627474/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品出锅。","img":"images/627474/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"美味的鹌鹑蛋肉包就做好啦。","img":"images/627474/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}